('Poppy Seed Bread', NULL, NULL, NULL, 50, '["4 eggs", "1 cup oil", "1 butter pecan cake mix", "1 small box instant coconut cream pudding", "1 cup hot water", "2 tablespoons poppy seeds"]'::jsonb, '["Mix eggs & oil. Add cake mix & blend.", "Gradually add coconut cream pudding & hot water. Mix with beater for 2 min.", "Add poppy seeds & mix by hand. Grease loaf pans, bake 40-50 min. at 325°."]'::jsonb, '["bread", "quick bread", "poppy seed", "cake mix", "dessert"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'Handwritten on a recipe page of a cookbook (page 86). Servings written as ''3 loafs'' (makes 3 loaves). Written on the card: ''Substitute for coconut cream pudding: vanilla pudding + 1 teas. coconut extract.''

