('Porcupine Meatballs', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["1 lb. hamburger", "1/3 cup rice, uncooked", "1 can tomato soup", "salt & pepper", "3 tbsp. onion (chopped)", "1 egg (beaten)", "1 sm. green pepper"]'::jsonb, '["Mix meat, rice, 1 tablespoon onion & beaten egg & season well. Form into balls & brown. Dilute tomato soup with equal amount of water, add remaining onion & chopped green pepper & pour over meat. Cover & simmer till done."]'::jsonb, '["beef", "meatballs", "rice", "handwritten"]'::jsonb, '["dinner"]'::jsonb, 'Handwritten notebook page (Evernote printout). A "Salisbury Steak" heading follows on the same page with nothing written under it.

