('Pumpkin Bread', NULL, NULL, NULL, 60, '["3 cups sugar", "3 1/2 cups flour (not sifted)", "1 1/2 teas cinnamon, nutmeg and salt", "2 teas baking soda", "1 cup salad oil", "1 can pumpkin (2 cups)", "2/3 cup water", "4 eggs", "1/2 ginger (ground)", "1/2 teas mace", "1/4 teas clove", "1/2 allspice", "nuts (optional)"]'::jsonb, '["Mix together in lg bowl the sugar, flour, cinnamon, nutmeg, salt and baking soda - make well in center & add: 1 cup salad oil, can pumpkin (2 cups), 2/3 cup water, 4 eggs.", "Beat in mixer 3-4 min.", "Grease 3 lg bread pans. Bake 350 about 45-60 min. Can add nuts if you like."]'::jsonb, '["bread", "pumpkin", "quick bread", "baking", "fall"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'Old handwritten recipe card pasted in a spiral recipe notebook. Added in different handwriting above the card: ''When using fresh pumpkin do not add 2/3 c water'' and extra spices ''1/2 ginger (ground), 1/2 teas mace, 1/4 teas clove, 1/2 allspice'' (units for ginger and allspice not written; probably teaspoons). The ''1 1/2 teas cinnamon, nutmeg and salt'' line is as written (likely 1 1/2 tsp of each).

Couldn''t read for sure: ''Can pumpkin (2 cups)'' - faded cursive; ''Beat in mixer 3-4 min'' ; ''Grease 3 lg bread pans''; bake time ''45-60 min'' (could be 45-50); ''(not sifted)''', NULL),
('Pumpkin Pie', NULL, NULL, NULL, 50, '["1 can pumpkin 16 oz", "3/4 c. sugar", "1 teas cinnamon", "1/2 teas ginger", "1/2 teas nutmeg", "1/2 teas allspice", "1/4 teas clove", "1/2 teas mace", "3 eggs", "2/3 c. evaporated milk", "1/2 c. milk"]'::jsonb, '["Cover edges with foil. 375° 40 min with foil. Remaining 10 min without foil."]'::jsonb, '["dessert", "pie", "pumpkin", "holiday", "Thanksgiving"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'Handwritten in a spiral recipe notebook. Temperature written over (looks like 375° written over another number). No crust listed. Upside-down at the top of the photo is the bottom of the facing page, showing only the title ''Mom''s Cinnamon Rolls''.

