('Stuffing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["1 bag herb seasoning stuffing", "1 bag of hot dog buns", "1 onion", "1 stalk celery (whole thing)", "4-5 bacon grease", "2 eggs beaten", "chicken broth", "sage, salt & pepper"]'::jsonb, '["Brown onion, celery & bacon grease, put in stuffing.", "2 eggs beaten.", "Chicken broth add to dressing.", "Sage, salt & pepper - easy on salt."]'::jsonb, '["stuffing", "dressing", "side", "Thanksgiving"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'Handwritten notebook page. "1 stalk celery (whole thing)" means the whole bunch. "4-5" bacon grease has no unit (probably tablespoons).

